/* 底部导航：颜色接住各页氛围背景的底色，首页天空、设备/我的夜空、其余暖雾色 */
.mem-tabbar {
  display: flex;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  padding: 8rpx 12rpx calc(12rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  background: rgba(250, 250, 248, 0.92);
  border-top: 1rpx solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
  box-shadow: 0 -12rpx 36rpx rgba(20, 35, 60, 0.06), inset 0 2rpx 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(30px) saturate(180%);
  backdrop-filter: blur(30px) saturate(180%);
}
.mem-tabbar-0 { background: rgba(214, 231, 244, 0.94); }
.mem-tabbar-1 { background: rgba(252, 236, 222, 0.94); }
.mem-tabbar-2 { background: rgba(254, 247, 234, 0.94); }
.mem-tabbar-dark {
  background: rgba(14, 24, 62, 0.94);
  border-top-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  box-shadow: 0 -12rpx 36rpx rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), inset 0 2rpx 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
}
.mem-tab {
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  flex: 1;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 4rpx;
  min-width: 128rpx;
  padding: 10rpx 0 6rpx;
  color: #6b7278;
}
.mem-tabbar-dark .mem-tab { color: rgba(236, 242, 250, 0.55); }
.mem-tab-indicator {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  width: 36rpx;
  height: 8rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4f9b9c 0%, #326e70 100%);
  box-shadow: 0 0 12rpx rgba(79, 155, 156, 0.6);
}
.mem-tabbar-dark .mem-tab-indicator { background: #9fe3d8; box-shadow: 0 0 14rpx rgba(159, 227, 216, 0.7); }
.mem-tab-icon { width: 48rpx; height: 48rpx; }
.mem-tab-icon rich-text { width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; }
.mem-tab-text { font-size: 20rpx; line-height: 1.3; }
.mem-tab-on { color: #16191c; font-weight: 700; }
.mem-tabbar-dark .mem-tab-on { color: #ffffff; }
